# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the managed workflows client package, authenticate to IBM Quantum Platform, and verify your setup."
msgstr "I-install ang managed workflows client package, mag-authenticate sa IBM Quantum Platform, at i-verify ang iyong setup."

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Install"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {#install}"
msgstr "I-install {#install}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Mga Kinakailangan {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed workflows enabled on your [IBM Quantum&reg; Platform instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Contact your administrator to enable it.\n"
msgstr "Naka-enable ang managed workflows sa iyong [IBM Quantum&reg; Platform instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Makipag-ugnayan sa iyong administrator para i-enable ito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An API key and the CRN of your instance. See [Find your access credentials](/guides/save-credentials#find-credentials).\n"
msgstr "Isang API key at ang CRN ng iyong instance. Tingnan ang [Find your access credentials](/guides/save-credentials#find-credentials).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Python 3.10 or later, in an active virtual environment. See [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit#local) for how to set up an environment.\n"
msgstr "Python 3.10 o mas bago, sa isang aktibong virtual environment. Tingnan ang [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit#local) para sa pag-set up ng environment.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start with AI skills {#quick-start-with-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Mabilis na simula gamit ang AI skills {#quick-start-with-ai-skills}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the AI skills in the [Qiskit Function templates repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) to help you install `qiskit-ibm-catalog`, package your existing local code, and deploy it as a managed workflow.\n"
msgstr "Magagamit mo ang AI skills sa [Qiskit Function templates repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) para tulungan kang i-install ang `qiskit-ibm-catalog`, i-package ang iyong kasalukuyang lokal na code, at i-deploy ito bilang managed workflow.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the client package {#install-the-client-package}"
msgstr "I-install ang client package {#install-the-client-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the `qiskit-ibm-catalog` package:\n"
msgstr "I-install ang package na `qiskit-ibm-catalog`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This command also installs `qiskit-serverless`, `qiskit`, and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` as dependencies. You do not need to install `qiskit-serverless` separately. The examples in these guides require `qiskit-ibm-catalog` 0.22.0 or later, which installs `qiskit-serverless` 0.38 and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.51.\n"
msgstr "Ini-install din ng command na ito ang `qiskit-serverless`, `qiskit`, at `qiskit-ibm-runtime` bilang mga dependency. Hindi mo na kailangang i-install nang hiwalay ang `qiskit-serverless`. Ang mga halimbawa sa mga gabay na ito ay nangangailangan ng `qiskit-ibm-catalog` 0.22.0 o mas bago, na nag-i-install ng `qiskit-serverless` 0.38 at `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.51.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You use two of these packages directly, in different places:\n"
msgstr "Direktang gumagamit ka ng dalawa sa mga package na ito, sa magkaibang lugar:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-ibm-catalog` is the client that you use on your local computer to upload workflows, run them, and get their results.\n"
msgstr "Ang `qiskit-ibm-catalog` ang client na ginagamit mo sa iyong lokal na computer para mag-upload ng mga workflow, patakbuhin ang mga ito, at kunin ang mga resulta nila.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-serverless` runs inside your workflow code. It provides helpers such as `get_arguments()`, `update_status()`, and `save_result()`.\n"
msgstr "Tumatakbo ang `qiskit-serverless` sa loob ng code ng iyong workflow. Nagbibigay ito ng mga helper tulad ng `get_arguments()`, `update_status()`, at `save_result()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update the client package {#update-the-client-package}"
msgstr "I-update ang client package {#update-the-client-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because managed workflows is in beta, the client package changes often. To check which version you have, run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Dahil nasa beta ang managed workflows, madalas magbago ang client package. Para tingnan kung anong bersyon ang mayroon ka, patakbuhin ang sumusunod na command:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Or, in Python:\n"
msgstr "Or, in Python:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To update to the latest version, run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Para mag-update sa pinakabagong bersyon, patakbuhin ang sumusunod na command:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the new version of `qiskit-ibm-catalog` requires a newer version of `qiskit-serverless`, this command also updates `qiskit-serverless`.\n"
msgstr "Kung nangangailangan ang bagong bersyon ng `qiskit-ibm-catalog` ng mas bagong bersyon ng `qiskit-serverless`, ina-update din ng command na ito ang `qiskit-serverless`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate {#authenticate}"
msgstr "Mag-authenticate {#authenticate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protect your API key\">\n"
"Do not include your API key in your workflow code, in scripts, or in notebook files. A running workflow uses the credentials and instance that you used to call `run()`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protektahan ang iyong API key\">\n"
"Huwag isama ang iyong API key sa code ng iyong workflow, sa mga script, o sa mga notebook file. Ang tumatakbong workflow ay gumagamit ng mga kredensyal at instance na ginamit mo sa pagtawag ng `run()`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The managed workflows client uses the same credentials as `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. If you already saved an account with `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`, the client loads your default saved account, and you can skip to [Verify your setup](#verify-your-setup).\n"
msgstr "Ginagamit ng managed workflows client ang parehong kredensyal gaya ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. Kung nag-save ka na ng account gamit ang `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`, ilo-load ng client ang iyong default na saved account, at maaari kang dumiretso sa [Verify your setup](#verify-your-setup).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not saved an account, save your API key and instance CRN one time in a trusted environment:\n"
msgstr "Kung hindi ka pa nakapag-save ng account, i-save nang isang beses ang iyong API key at instance CRN sa isang pinagkakatiwalaang environment:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This method writes your credentials to the same file as [`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#save_account). The client uses the `ibm_quantum_platform` channel by default, so you do not need to set `channel`. To save more than one account, set `name`, and pass the same `name` when you create the client.\n"
msgstr "Isinusulat ng method na ito ang iyong mga kredensyal sa parehong file ng [`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#save_account). Gumagamit ang client ng channel na `ibm_quantum_platform` bilang default, kaya hindi mo na kailangang i-set ang `channel`. Para mag-save ng higit sa isang account, i-set ang `name`, at ipasa ang parehong `name` kapag gumawa ka ng client.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more options, such as saving several accounts or selecting an instance automatically, see [Save your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials). If you work on a public computer or another untrusted environment, do not save your credentials. Instead, follow [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
msgstr "Para sa higit pang opsyon, tulad ng pag-save ng ilang account o awtomatikong pagpili ng instance, tingnan ang [Save your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials). Kung gumagamit ka ng pampublikong computer o ibang hindi pinagkakatiwalaang environment, huwag i-save ang iyong mga kredensyal. Sa halip, sundin ang [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify your setup {#verify-your-setup}"
msgstr "I-verify ang iyong setup {#verify-your-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect to managed workflows with your saved account, and list the workflows that you uploaded:\n"
msgstr "Kumonekta sa managed workflows gamit ang iyong saved account, at ilista ang mga workflow na na-upload mo:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not uploaded a workflow yet, the output is an empty list (`[]`). If you see an authentication error, the client did not find valid credentials. Check the account that you saved in the [Authenticate](#authenticate) section.\n"
msgstr "Kung wala ka pang na-upload na workflow, walang laman na listahan ang output (`[]`). Kung may makita kang authentication error, hindi nakahanap ang client ng valid na kredensyal. Suriin ang account na na-save mo sa seksyong [Authenticate](#authenticate).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Deploy your first managed workflow](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow) to upload a workflow, run it, and get its result.\n"
"- To start from working code, deploy one of the [Qiskit Function templates](/guides/qiskit-function-templates), or adapt a base template for your own workflow.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- [Deploy your first managed workflow](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow) para mag-upload ng workflow, patakbuhin ito, at kunin ang resulta nito.\n"
"- Para magsimula sa gumaganang code, i-deploy ang isa sa mga [Qiskit Function templates](/guides/qiskit-function-templates), o iangkop ang isang base template para sa sarili mong workflow.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
